From: Michael J Gruber <github@grubix.eu>
Date: Thu, 12 Sep 2019 16:34:38 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 06/13] 2-3: print as a function

2to3 -f print
This converts all print statements to use the function form. Python 2
can use this with the help of a __future__ import.

Signed-off-by: Michael J Gruber <github@grubix.eu>
